<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!-- ======================================================
       폼별 메인 HediffDef: 변신 상태 마커 + 스탯/능력치 보정
       hediffClass: ShapeshifterFramework.Hediffs.Hediff_ShapeshiftForm
       ====================================================== -->

  <!-- 1) 베어 폼 메인 헤디프 -->
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>SSFTest_BearFormHediff</defName>
    <hediffClass>ShapeshifterFramework.Hediffs.Hediff_ShapeshiftForm</hediffClass>
    <label>bear form</label>
    <description>곰으로 변신한 상태. 이동 속도 증가, 근접 적중/회피 강화, 조작 능력 저하.</description>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.4, 0.8, 0.4)</defaultLabelColor>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <MoveSpeed>1.5</MoveSpeed>
        </statOffsets>
        <statFactors>
          <MeleeHitChance>1.20</MeleeHitChance>
          <MeleeDodgeChance>1.15</MeleeDodgeChance>
        </statFactors>
        <capMods>
          <li><capacity>Manipulation</capacity><setMax>0.2</setMax></li>
          <li><capacity>Talking</capacity><postFactor>0.1</postFactor></li>
          <li><capacity>Moving</capacity><postFactor>1.30</postFactor></li>
          <li><capacity>Sight</capacity><postFactor>1.10</postFactor></li>
        </capMods>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- 2) 곰 전사 폼 메인 헤디프 -->
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>SSFTest_BearWarriorFormHediff</defName>
    <hediffClass>ShapeshifterFramework.Hediffs.Hediff_ShapeshiftForm</hediffClass>
    <label>bear warrior form</label>
    <description>곰 전사로 변신한 상태. 이동 속도, 회피 증가, 피해 경감.</description>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.4, 0.8, 0.4)</defaultLabelColor>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <MoveSpeed>0.5</MoveSpeed>
          <MeleeDodgeChance>10</MeleeDodgeChance>
        </statOffsets>
        <statFactors>
          <IncomingDamageFactor>0.8</IncomingDamageFactor>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- 3) 양 폼 메인 헤디프 -->
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>SSFTest_SheepFormHediff</defName>
    <hediffClass>ShapeshifterFramework.Hediffs.Hediff_ShapeshiftForm</hediffClass>
    <label>sheep form</label>
    <description>양으로 변신한 상태. 이동 속도 감소.</description>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.8, 0.8, 0.4)</defaultLabelColor>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <MoveSpeed>-1.0</MoveSpeed>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- 4) 암흑 기사 폼 메인 헤디프 -->
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>SSFTest_DarkKnightFormHediff</defName>
    <hediffClass>ShapeshifterFramework.Hediffs.Hediff_ShapeshiftForm</hediffClass>
    <label>dark knight form</label>
    <description>암흑 기사로 변신한 상태. 이동 속도 감소, 회피 증가, 대폭 피해 경감.</description>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.4, 0.4, 0.8)</defaultLabelColor>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <MoveSpeed>-0.3</MoveSpeed>
          <MeleeDodgeChance>15</MeleeDodgeChance>
        </statOffsets>
        <statFactors>
          <IncomingDamageFactor>0.6</IncomingDamageFactor>
          <MeleeWeapon_CooldownMultiplier>0.85</MeleeWeapon_CooldownMultiplier>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- 5a) 수인 폼 메인 헤디프 -->
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>SSFTest_BeastkinFormHediff</defName>
    <hediffClass>ShapeshifterFramework.Hediffs.Hediff_ShapeshiftForm</hediffClass>
    <label>beastkin form</label>
    <description>수인으로 변신한 상태. 이동 속도, 회피, 근접 적중 증가.</description>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.4, 0.8, 0.4)</defaultLabelColor>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <MoveSpeed>0.8</MoveSpeed>
          <MeleeDodgeChance>5</MeleeDodgeChance>
        </statOffsets>
        <statFactors>
          <MeleeHitChance>1.10</MeleeHitChance>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- 5b) 야수 폼 메인 헤디프 -->
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>SSFTest_FullBeastFormHediff</defName>
    <hediffClass>ShapeshifterFramework.Hediffs.Hediff_ShapeshiftForm</hediffClass>
    <label>full beast form</label>
    <description>완전한 야수로 변신한 상태. 이동 속도 대폭 증가, 피해 경감.</description>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.8, 0.4, 0.4)</defaultLabelColor>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <MoveSpeed>2.0</MoveSpeed>
        </statOffsets>
        <statFactors>
          <IncomingDamageFactor>0.7</IncomingDamageFactor>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- 6) 수호자 폼 메인 헤디프 -->
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>SSFTest_GuardianFormHediff</defName>
    <hediffClass>ShapeshifterFramework.Hediffs.Hediff_ShapeshiftForm</hediffClass>
    <label>guardian form</label>
    <description>수호자로 변신한 상태. 이동 속도 증가, 피해 경감.</description>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.4, 0.8, 0.8)</defaultLabelColor>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <MoveSpeed>0.3</MoveSpeed>
        </statOffsets>
        <statFactors>
          <IncomingDamageFactor>0.85</IncomingDamageFactor>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- 7) 유령 폼 메인 헤디프 -->
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>SSFTest_PhantomFormHediff</defName>
    <hediffClass>ShapeshifterFramework.Hediffs.Hediff_ShapeshiftForm</hediffClass>
    <label>phantom form</label>
    <description>유령으로 변신한 상태. 이동 속도 증가.</description>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.6, 0.7, 0.9)</defaultLabelColor>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <MoveSpeed>1.0</MoveSpeed>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- 8) 종족 제한 폼 메인 헤디프 -->
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>SSFTest_RaceLockedFormHediff</defName>
    <hediffClass>ShapeshifterFramework.Hediffs.Hediff_ShapeshiftForm</hediffClass>
    <label>race locked form</label>
    <description>인간 전용 강화 상태. 이동 속도, 회피 증가, 피해 경감.</description>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.8, 0.6, 0.4)</defaultLabelColor>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <MoveSpeed>0.5</MoveSpeed>
          <MeleeDodgeChance>10</MeleeDodgeChance>
        </statOffsets>
        <statFactors>
          <IncomingDamageFactor>0.75</IncomingDamageFactor>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- ======================================================
       sustain 조건 테스트용 헤디프 — GuardianForm 유지 조건
       FibrousMechanites 대신 커스텀 헤디프로 교체하여 독립적 테스트
       ====================================================== -->
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>SSFTest_Hediff_GuardianMark</defName>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <label>guardian's mark</label>
    <description>수호자의 각인. 이 표식이 남아있는 동안 수호자 변신 상태를 유지할 수 있다. 표식이 사라지면 변신이 해제된다.</description>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.3, 0.8, 0.6)</defaultLabelColor>
    <maxSeverity>1.0</maxSeverity>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>marked</label>
        <statOffsets>
          <PsychicSensitivity>0.05</PsychicSensitivity>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- ======================================================
       조건부 자동 변신 테스트 — HediffComp_AutoShift
       이 hediff를 부여하면, 밝기 0.5 미만(밤) 또는 체력 30% 이하 시
       80% 확률로 곰 폼으로 자동 변신
       ====================================================== -->
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>SSFTest_Hediff_AutoShiftCurse</defName>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <label>beast curse (auto-shift test)</label>
    <description>야수의 저주. 밤이 되거나 체력이 30% 이하로 떨어지면 80% 확률로 곰으로 자동 변신한다.</description>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.9, 0.4, 0.2)</defaultLabelColor>
    <maxSeverity>1.0</maxSeverity>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>cursed</label>
      </li>
    </stages>
    <comps>
      <li Class="ShapeshifterFramework.Hediffs.HediffCompProperties_AutoShift">
        <formDefName>SSFTest_BearForm</formDefName>
        <healthThreshold>0.3</healthThreshold>
        <triggerSunGlowBelow>0.5</triggerSunGlowBelow>
        <checkIntervalTicks>120</checkIntervalTicks>
        <successChance>0.8</successChance>
      </li>
    </comps>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- 전투 자동 변신 테스트 — triggerInCombat + triggerOnce -->
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>SSFTest_Hediff_CombatAutoShift</defName>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <label>combat instinct (auto-shift test)</label>
    <description>전투 본능. 전투에 돌입하면 곰 전사로 1회 자동 변신한다.</description>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.8, 0.3, 0.3)</defaultLabelColor>
    <maxSeverity>1.0</maxSeverity>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>instinct ready</label>
      </li>
    </stages>
    <comps>
      <li Class="ShapeshifterFramework.Hediffs.HediffCompProperties_AutoShift">
        <formDefName>SSFTest_BearWarriorForm</formDefName>
        <triggerInCombat>true</triggerInCombat>
        <checkIntervalTicks>60</checkIntervalTicks>
        <triggerOnce>true</triggerOnce>
      </li>
    </comps>
  </HediffDef>

</Defs>
